OL,3,GNEWSALong delays after road closed
OL,4,Afollowing coach fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists are facing long delays in
OL,7,FKent after a section of the A21 was
OL,8,Fclosed following a coach fire.
OL,10,FNational Highways says the road has
OL,11,Fbeen closed southbound between the A225
OL,12,Fat Morleys Roundabout and the A26 in
OL,13,FTonbridge, with four miles (6.43km) of
OL,14,Fcongestion and delays of 45 minutes.
OL,16,FThe incident was first reported by
OL,17,Ftravel site Inrix just before 09:00
OL,18,FGMT.
OL,20,FA spokesperson for National Highways
OL,21,Fsay diversions are in place and
OL,22,Femergency services are at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
